# Fast city test (testspeed, 2026-11-08): boot from the first save ("3. Forward Momentum", start of New Marais;
# the game auto-loads the newest save at boot, no menu), the 70 s city intro comic is the 4 s placeholder
# (fastmovies), then a WAIT for the Kuo cutscene to end (X does not skip it, and a late X made Cole jump and the
# HUD check miss: wkc1-A1), and the route starts at the moment the
# gameplay HUD is back (screen state, work\fast_refs\city_hud.png). Then the same inputs every run:
#   0-10 s   stand still: the dock and the street ahead (static view)
#   10-18 s  camera pan right (right stick)
#   19-44 s  walk forward (left stick), into the street
# Run: tools\fast.ps1 -Tag X -Steps tools\fast_city.steps
#! seconds 200
#! anchor_range 55:100
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! fastmovies 1
#! windows 2:10,11:18,22:44
#! pad w10:0x800000:8,w19:0x10000:25
wait v_02_city_intro 120
sleep 2
waitimg city_hud 40,20,340,130 15 120
sleep 2
anchor
at 6
shot a6
at 15
shot a15
at 30
shot a30
at 43
shot a43
at 45
close
